B.acr=new A.cY("Kenya Data Protection Act (2019):","Enforces our Zero Video Storage policy: frames stay in transient volatile memory with only numeric scores and mathematical integrity hashes persisted.",B.cD,null)
B.aca=new A.cY("Consumer Protection Act (2012):","Deterministic verification engines, transparent upfront gateway fee disclosures, and formal 15-minute Human-in-the-Loop dispute resolution satisfy fairness standards.",B.cD,null)
